    "description": "<section class=\"hol-item-reference\"><p class=\"hol-automation-label\"><strong>Automation:</strong> Rules reference · resolve effects at the table</p><div class=\"hol-reference-flavor\"><p>You settle your weight into the armor. The sweep strikes your legs, but you choose to remain standing.</p></div><h2>Rules</h2><dl class=\"hol-reference-details\"><div><dt>Action</dt><dd>Passive</dd></div><div><dt>Attribute</dt><dd>None (no roll)</dd></div><div><dt>Target / range / shape</dt><dd>Self while wearing armor.</dd></div><div><dt>Equipment / acquisition</dt><dd>Worn armor.</dd></div><div><dt>Type</dt><dd>Skill / Defense</dd></div></dl><div class=\"hol-reference-rules\"><p>While wearing armor, gain Stability 2. When an effect would make you Prone, you may remain standing.</p></div><p class=\"hol-reference-source\"><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/bruceamoser/heroes-of-legend/blob/f3fb98ca03b046335fcc730c1b05689bebf091b4/design/cards/weight-of-iron.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">design/cards/weight-of-iron.md</a> at <code>f3fb98ca03b046335fcc730c1b05689bebf091b4</code>.</p></section>",
